17. Make everything tiny in the name of minimalism.
18. Sacrifice accessibility for aesthetics.
19. Leave old Varek logos, browser titles, or extension assets visible.
20. Deliver only a mockup or a partially updated interface.

The goal is radical visual simplification with complete functional preservation.

