Final guiding principle

Cole should look like an application where every unnecessary visual element has been removed, and everything remaining has been designed with extraordinary care.

Use fewer elements, better hierarchy, better typography, more deliberate spacing, and restrained contrast.

Make the interface visually simple without making the product functionally simplistic.

The finished experience should be timeless, elegant, calm, exceptionally usable, and unmistakably premium.

